  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in the bottom of a large clay tagine or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add veal and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add curry paste and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add almond butter, basil, horapa, coconut milk, almonds, salt, black pepper, cumin, and coriander.",
    "Stir to combine, then bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional basil leaves and almonds, if desired."
